    <!-- Huddle (huddle/, ui/HuddleScreen.kt, ui/HuddleSheets.kt): friends send each other songs, albums and playlists;
         only song details travel, sealed on the phone. Labels are 3 words or fewer; sentences only in sheets and
         dialogs. Never the words key, encrypt or relay in the main flow. -->
